# This app needs almost no configuration.
#
# On Render, DATABASE_URL is provided automatically by the blueprint — you do
# NOT need to set it yourself. This file is only useful if you ever run the
# backend on your own machine.
#
# Leave DATABASE_URL unset locally to use a throwaway SQLite file instead of Postgres.

# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# ---- HERE routing (required for baking geometry) ----------------------------
# HERE_API_KEY=...

# ---- Admin protection ------------------------------------------------------
# ⚠️ STILL UNSET ON RENDER AS OF 2026-08-27. While it is unset, _check_admin() is a
# no-op and EVERY admin endpoint is open — including the ones that spend HERE calls
# per click (zone writes, haul-road attach/detach, bulk bake).
#   openssl rand -hex 24
# then paste the same value into the admin token field in the Data Management header.
# ADMIN_TOKEN=

# ---- Google Street View (Phase 2.5a, optional) ------------------------------
# Street View imagery in location popups. Entirely optional: with no key set, the
# popups simply show no photo and nothing else changes.
#
# This is Google Maps Platform — a SEPARATE product, key and bill from HERE. Enable
# only the "Street View Static API" for this key and restrict it to your server's IP.
# The key is held by the backend and never sent to the browser.
#
# Cost: metadata lookups are free and consume no quota; IMAGES are billable. The app
# always checks metadata first and never requests an image for a location Google has
# no imagery for. Read the current rate off Google's pricing page — it has changed
# twice recently, so no figure is quoted anywhere in this repo.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional but recommended: Google's URL signing secret. With it set, requests are
# signed so a leaked key cannot be used elsewhere. Without it, everything still works.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_URL_SIGNING_SECRET=

# ---- Tark Tee road restrictions (Phase 2.5a) --------------------------------
# No key needed. Estonian Transport Administration open data, fetched server-side
# from tarktee.ee and cached for 30 minutes. Nothing to configure.

# The Mapbox token lives in map/config.js (it is a browser token), not here.

# ---- 2026-09-02, Task F: access codes (checked by the server) -----------------
# Set any of these and the three demo codes (submitter123 / planner123 / admin123)
# stop working. An IPT code sees only forecast lines whose `ipt` is that IPT and
# cannot approve. PLANNER_CODE sees every IPT and approves. ADMIN_CODE is planner
# plus the admin surface, which STILL needs ADMIN_TOKEN for /api/admin/*.
# IPT1_CODE=
# IPT2_CODE=
# IPT3_CODE=
# IPT4_CODE=
# IPT5_CODE=
# IPT6_CODE=
# PLANNER_CODE=
# ADMIN_CODE=
